Eight-symbol superpermutation of length 46,178

The mathematical completion construction, selections, slices and closed
trails are due to Jay Pantone:
https://github.com/jaypantone/superperm-upper-43-80
Commit c8fb7ffdd69be1375580710ae11b47a295b1f0f6; Apache License 2.0.

The search uses arbitrary visible row lengths as developed by Jakub
Halfar, and used his generator, word search tools and independent C
checker during research:
https://github.com/jhalfar/superpermutations
Commit c9cb923057f757efa7c0f0e4c4cc1677ef3e6d3b; Apache License 2.0.
Halfar credits weight-two trail cuts to rumstd and cuts inside a one-cycle
to Theo H. These wider cut types did not improve the final word.

Halfar's work was produced with Claude (Opus 5.5) in Claude Code.

The new selection and search orchestration were prepared for William
